menuconfig PAW3222
    bool "PAW3222 mouse optical sensor"
    select SPI
    help
      Enable PAW3222 mouse optical sensor.

if PAW3222

config PAW3222_POLL_INTERVAL_MS
    int "Motion polling interval while the sensor reports motion (ms)"
    default 15
    range 4 50
    help
      After a motion interrupt the driver polls the sensor at this interval
      until motion stops, then re-arms the interrupt. Lower values give a
      smoother cursor at the cost of more SPI traffic and current.

endif
